# the spend ledger, plans and verdicts are checked in to the PRIVATE `all` repo:
#   ~/BGit/all/politics/charlie_kirk/flights/<vendor>/
# (proprietary/code/private_store.js). The published form is the restated data
# in proprietary/data/<vendor>_restated/, which IS tracked. Backstop only.
# ============================================================================
